      "description": "<p>The fire is one of the deadliest such incidents in the popular tourist destination in ⁠recent years</p><p>An explosive fire at a popular pub in Thailand’s ⁠capital, Bangkok, has killed 27 ⁠people and left another 22 ​in critical condition, in one of the deadliest such incidents in the tourism hub in recent years.</p><p>Officials said they were investigating whether emergency exits may have been obstructed, hindering people from escaping the burning Rong Beer Na Lat Phrao pub.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/12/at-least-27-killed-in-blaze-at-bangkok-pub-thai-officials-say\">Continue reading...</a>",
